{
    "title": "BET+",
    "description": "BET+ is a premium online streaming service with over 2,500 hours of your favorite Black content from the best Black creators. Stream Black culture; including: the movies you remember, the TV shows you love and the new series you can't live without. \r\n\r\nDive into modern favorites like The Ms. Pat Show and All the Queen's Men. Then, make every day a throwback with classics like Martin, The Wayans Brothers and Tyler Perry's House of Payne. Binge exclusive originals from Black creators like Tracy Oliver's First Wives Club, Kirk Franklin's Kingdom Business and Carl Weber's The Family Business. Plus, there are movies, plays and new series from Tyler Perry that you'll only find on BET+, including new episodes of Tyler Perry's Zatima and Ruthless. Welcome to the home of Black culture!\r\n\r\nCheck out some of the hits and exclusives:\r\n\r\n\u2022\tAverage Joe\r\n\u2022\tDiarra From Detroit\r\n\u2022\tTyler Perry's Bruh\r\n\u2022\tTyler Perry's Ruthless\r\n\u2022\tDon't Tell Mom the Babysitter's Dead\r\n\u2022\tThe Ms. Pat Show\r\n\u2022\tAll the Queen's Men\r\n\u2022\tTyler Perry's Zatima\r\n\u2022\tTyler Perry's Sistas\r\n\u2022\tCarl Weber's The Family Business\r\n\u2022\tThe Despaired\r\n\u2022\tIncision\r\n\u2022\tFirst Wives Club\r\n\u2022\tYoung. Wild. Free.\r\n\u2022\tThe Reading\r\n\u2022\tMartin\r\n\u2022\tThe Porter\r\n\u2022\tBigger\r\n\u2022\tKingdom Business\r\n\u2022\tTyler Perry's Madea's Farewell: The Play\r\n\r\n\r\nAPP FEATURES:\r\n\r\n\u2022\tWith your own personalized watch list, you can save your favorites and add new movies and series to enjoy.\r\n\r\n\u2022\tIf multiple people are using BET+, there are now individualized user profiles to keep each person's favorites in one place. \r\n\r\n\u2022\tEnjoy Cross-Platform Continue Watching, a new feature that allows you to start watching an episode or movie on one platform, then pick up where you left off, even on a different platform.\r\n\r\n\u2022\tStart your subscription today! Your first seven days are free, then your paid monthly BET+ subscription begins. You can avoid auto-renew charges by canceling at least 24 hours before the end of your trial or current billing period.\r\n\r\n\u2022\tChromecast support lets you cast your favorite shows to your TV. Just hook up your TV to your Chromecast device.\r\n\r\nFull episode streaming is available within the U.S. only. \r\n\r\nFor help, visit www.bet.com/betplus/help or contact support@bet.plus.\r\n\r\nThe Terms of Use for this app include arbitration for disputes -- see https://www.bet.plus/legal/aqgb7j/arbitration-faqs\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://privacy.paramount.com/policy\r\n\r\nYour Privacy Choices: https://privacy.paramount.com/app-donotsell\r\n\r\nCalifornia Notice: https://privacy.paramount.com/en/policy#additional-information-us-states",
